# NOTE: .scratch/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds the wayfinder map, its tickets, the
# paper digest and the research findings — the canonical artifacts of this project. Do not add
# it here.

# --- Licence enforcement: ZINC seed structures must never be committed ---------------------
# ZINC's terms forbid redistributing major portions of the database. The repo ships the
# generation script, ZINC IDs and the sigma cache — not the structures themselves.
# See .scratch/research/zinc-seed-source.md and the map's Known traps section.
data/
seeds/
*.smi
*.smi.gz
*.sdf
*.sdf.gz
*.mol2
*.parquet

# --- Structural data (PLINDER downloads are ~1.5 GiB and are re-derivable) -----------------
plinder/
*.cif
*.cif.gz
*.pdbqt

# --- Model weights, adapters, checkpoints ---------------------------------------------------
checkpoints/
outputs/
models/
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.bin
*.pt
*.ckpt
adapter_model*

# --- Training run artifacts -----------------------------------------------------------------
wandb/
runs/
logs/
*.log

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- OS / editor ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Third-party publisher PDFs --------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept locally for reading, excluded from version control: these are publisher-copyright PDFs
# (e.g. ACS / J. Chem. Inf. Model.) and this repo is destined to be public. Git history is
# permanent, so they must not enter it. The arXiv source paper in .scratch/reference/ IS
# committed — it is CC BY 4.0, which permits redistribution.
References/
*.pdf

# --- Unsloth / training build artifacts ------------------------------------------------------
# Unsloth writes regex-rewritten copies of TRL's trainers to ./unsloth_compiled_cache at import
# time, relative to the *current working directory*. Run anything from the repo root and 2 MB of
# generated source lands here. It is a build artifact, never an input.
unsloth_compiled_cache/
